[32.552492, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[Hssrf-lab | Use your application's actual fetcher\r\n=======================================================================================\r\n\r\n"]
[32.552612, "o", "The same checker drives the reusable GitHub Action.\r\n\r\nCaptured unsafe run:    8/9 reached, exit 1\r\nCaptured protected run: 9/9 blocked, exit 0\r\n\r\nConnect your existing fetch function and its real policy errors.\r\nKeep the successful-entry and unsafe-client controls.\r\n\r\nGet the tutorial, code, raw reports and recording:\r\ngithub.com/roshan-amble/ssrf-lab\r\n\r\nBounded regression coverage. Not a security certification.\r\n"]
